  "full_text": "My little Saturday night live episode with Terry, the control system engineer. We have designed a new flight system for the new fighter, and Mr. Terry is the senior control engineer. Mr. Pilot says, sir, there's a major problem with pilot-induced oscillations, and you're a crappy engineer. You're not qualified. Look, bitch. I don't have any problem. You just gotta fly the motherfucker like this. How are you gonna be? I'm an excellent engineer. You a shitty ass pilot. You just gotta... First gear. That's all you gotta do. Just keep the stroke like that. How are you gonna be? Just like all day long. How are you gonna be? I need a weapon system over here. You're just a spastic monkey. I don't want to hear this shit about me being incompetent engineer. I can fly the bitch. Just let me try. I'll prove it to you. Fucking fly the bitch. Okay, Mr. Lunch over here. It ain't no problem. See, I don't have any problem. You're just a spastic monkey. You can't do it. And then, like, when you want to, like, dampen, how are you going to be? Just exponentially dampen the stick. Piece of cake. I don't want to hear any shit about this. Incompetech Control Engineer. You're just a shitty ass pilot. Hey, fuck you! Or the bitch. Gonna evolutionize your ass. That's where you gonna be. Hey, go fucking fight it out. All right. Oh, no, dampener. Oop. Piece of cake. Like, how it gonna be? The exponential damping. Whoop. Whoop. Ha ha. Okay, whoop.",
